{"id":"torrey:kenites-the","source":"torrey","name":"Kenites, The","slug":"kenites-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Originally a people of Canaan — Ge 15:19.","refs":[["Gen",15,19,15,19]]},{"text":"Connected with the Midianites — Nu 10:29; Jdj 4:11.","refs":[["Num",10,29,10,29],["Judg",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"Dwelt in strongholds — Nu 24:21.","refs":[["Num",24,21,24,21]]},{"text":"Had many cities — 1Sa 30:29.","refs":[["1Sam",30,29,30,29]]},{"text":"Intermarried with. — Ex 2:21; Jdj 1:16.","refs":[["Exod",2,21,2,21],["Judg",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Invited, to accompany Israel. — Nu 10:29-32.","refs":[["Num",10,29,10,32]]},{"text":"Part of, dwelt with Israel — Jdj 1:16; 4:11.","refs":[["Judg",1,16,1,16],["Judg",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"Part of, dwelt with the Amalekites — 1Sa 15:6.","refs":[["1Sam",15,6,15,6]]},{"text":"Showed kindness to Israel in the desert — Ex 18:1-27.","refs":[["Exod",18,1,18,27]]},{"text":"Not destroyed with the Amalekites — 1Sa 15:6.","refs":[["1Sam",15,6,15,6]]},{"text":"The Rechabites descended from — 1Ch 2:55.","refs":[["1Chr",2,55,2,55]]},{"text":"Sisera slain by Jael one of — Jdj 4:22; 5:24.","refs":[["Judg",4,22,4,22],["Judg",5,24,5,24]]},{"text":"Pretended that he invaded. — 1Sa 27:10.","refs":[["1Sam",27,10,27,10]]},{"text":"Sent part of the spoil of war to. — 1Sa 30:29.","refs":[["1Sam",30,29,30,29]]},{"text":"Ruin of, predicted — Nu 24:21,22.","refs":[["Num",24,21,24,21],["Num",24,22,24,22]]}],"refCount":20}
